    claim: "Manifolds, tangent bundles, connections, geodesics, Riemannian metrics. Gauss's theorema egregium said curvature is intrinsic; [[riemann|Riemann]] made the metric a field; Einstein made the field dynamical. [[topology|Topology]] remembers what survives if you forget the metric.",
